1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:04,804
The only way back out is through a protein turbine, ATP synthase.

2
00:00:04,804 --> 00:00:12,825
As protons rush through it into the stroma, it spins, and joins ADP and phosphate into ATP.

3
00:00:12,825 --> 00:00:19,192
This is chemiosmosis, and because light drives it, it is called photophosphorylation.

